<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Harshini's Portfolio</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            background: linear-gradient(-45deg, #ff6b6b, #6c5ce7, #00cec9, #fdcb6e);
            background-size: 400% 400%;
            animation: gradientBG 10s ease infinite;
        }

        @keyframes gradientBG {
            0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
            100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
        }

        .container {
            margin: 50px auto;
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 800px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 45px;
            animation: glow 2s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes glow {
            from {
                text-shadow: 0 0 10px white;
            }
            to {
                text-shadow: 0 0 25px yellow;
            }
        }

        img {
            width: 300px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            transition: transform 0.5s;
        }

        img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1) rotate(3deg);
        }

        p {
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        button {
            background: #ff4757;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-size: 18px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 20px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #2ed573;
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <h1>🌟 Welcome to My Portfolio 🌟</h1>

        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
            Hello! I am Harshini, a B.Tech AIML student passionate about
            Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and Web Development.
        </p>

        <h2>My Goals</h2>
        <p>
            I aim to enhance my coding skills, build innovative projects,
            participate in internships, and contribute to the tech community.
        </p>

        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?w=600"
             alt="Technology Image">

        <br>

        <button onclick="alert('Thank you for visiting my portfolio!')">
            Click Me
        </button>

    </div>

</body>

</html>